<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11165"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 10, 2005 - 12:42 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Icyou can you get me a description of this woman and any link to  news etc of her disappearance date, I completely agree with the storage Idea, O hope LE is checking on that. I would like any info you could give me about her, where she lived etc. So we can see if we can find out what happened to her Thanks E.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
