<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12461"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Icyou<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Icyou<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 31, 2005 - 12:01 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->okay,  after reading more about Marine Hedge&#39;s murder, I am convinced that Kathryn Adam was killed by BTK...many similarities.  BTK is the only killer I&#39;ve heard of that leaves the vehicle in a public place. Russell&#39;s Restaurant is right next to the I-135 onramp.  Plus, Salina just does not have these kind of murders.  Murders here are few and far between, and few go unsolved. I&#39;m sure he wanted her to be found. I would guess her remains to be somewhere very close to here.  There was a man a couple of weeks ago in Topeka that found human remains in a wooded area on his property....haven&#39;t heard much about it since.  Haven&#39;t heard back from Al Augustine.&#40;not that I really expected to.&#41;<!--/Text--></td></tr>
