<!--Post: 14201--><!--Time: 1125370598-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST14201"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Icyou<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Icyou<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, August 29, 2005 - 7:56 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->my thoughts exactly...the blood...I think things got out of hand and he had to use a knife again a la Kathryn Bright or a gun.  I truly think she is probably under a bridge near Falun or somewhere else out west of Salina.  Thanks for the comments!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
