</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bmodule<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, August 29, 2005 - 11:10 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->She may have been dropped under a bridge, but after 17 years of flooding she would be long gone by now. Remember, however, that Rader had intended to put Marine Hedge in a grave in the woods, but ran out of time.  <BR> <BR>There my be some clue in the &#34;Motherlode&#34; or the van to link Rader to the case though.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
