<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST14214"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Icyou<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Icyou<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, August 30, 2005 - 9:57 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I hope so...btw, it was Dolores Davis. <IMG SRC="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/clipart/happy.gif" ALT=":-&#41;" BORDER=0> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
