<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST14219"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, August 31, 2005 - 6:31 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Here is the boy scout map for Kansas:  <BR><a href="http://www.quivira.org/trailguide/map.htm" target=_top>http://www.quivira.org/trailguide/map.htm</a>  <BR>BTW it was boy scout pack #491 and troop #491  <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
