<!--/Post: 14279-->
<!--Post: 14282--><!--Time: 1125774925-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST14282"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Icyou<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Icyou<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, September 03, 2005 - 12:15 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Itty, thanks for the scout info...B module, I&#39;m sure she was killed here in Salina, I have no idea where her route was, but do you think Rader would have kept tabs on her in park city and followed her to Salina?  Boggles the mind.  It&#39;s hard telling...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
